    "The last action taken anywhere in the gallery.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Den sista åtgärden som vidtagits någonstans i galleriet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The listener binds to 127.0.0.1 and your iPhone reaches it through an outbound encrypted relay, so nothing is published on your local network and macOS never asks for that permission.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lyssnaren binds till 127.0.0.1 och din iPhone når den via ett utgående krypterat relä, så ingenting publiceras på ditt lokala nätverk och macOS ber aldrig om den behörigheten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The local mirror is ready on 127.0.0.1:%lld. Waiting for the encrypted relay…": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Det lokala spegeln är redo på 127.0.0.1:%lld. Väntar på det krypterade reläet…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The native content remains while a host-rendered CI accessory is composed.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Den egena innehållet förblir medan en värdrenderad CI-tillägg är sammansatt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The native visual subtree is replaced while the working indicator, hover actions, selection and row identity stay in Threading's shell.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Det inbyggda visuella underträdet ersätts, medan arbetsindikator, hovringsåtgärder, markering och radidentitet ligger kvar i Threadings skal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The package moves to Threading's recoverable Removed directory rather than being deleted.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paketet flyttas till Threadings återställningsbara Removed-katalog i stället för att raderas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The package was moved to %@ and can be recovered from there.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paketet har flyttats till %@ och kan återhämtas därifrån."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The private listener failed (%@).": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Det privata lyssnaren misslyckades (%@)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The provider did not register service “%@” v%lld.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tillhandtagaren deklarerade inte tjänsten “%@” v%lld."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The provider extension “%@” is not running.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tillhandtagartillägget “%@” körs inte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The remote surface is unavailable.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Det fjärransiktet är inte tillgängligt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The response exceeds the brokered size limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Svaret överskrider den förmedlade storleksgränsen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The same selected destination language in horizontal strips and sidebars.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Samma valda målsspråk i horisontella strimor och sidofält."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The scroll factory composes all three boundaries.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scrollfabriken sammansätter alla tre gränserna."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected chat-name effect with fixed, app-owned timing.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Den valda chattnamneffekten med fixerad, appägna tidsinställning."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The shell will stop, and the session moves out of the sidebar into Settings ▸ Archived, where it can be restored.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Skalet stoppas och konversationen flyttas från sidofältet till Inställningar ▸ Arkiverade, där den kan återställas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The shell will stop. The session stays in the sidebar.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Skalet stoppas. Konversationen ligger kvar i sidofältet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sidebar's ground: the platform's material under System, the theme's own opaque surface under a style. Switch the theme above to watch it trade one for the other.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sidofältets bakgrund: plattformens material med System och temats egen ogenomskinliga yta med ett tema. Byt tema ovan för att se hur den ena ersätter den andra."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sign-in code expired before it was entered.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inloggningskoden hann gå ut innan den angavs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sign-in was declined on GitHub.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inloggningen nekades på GitHub."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The site's touch icon or favicon becomes the project's icon.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Webbplatsens touchikonen eller favicon blir projektets ikon."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The strip those tabs live in: select, close, drag a chip along it, or reorder from its secondary-click menu.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Den strim som de flikar lever i: välj, stäng, dra en chip längs den eller ordna om från dess sekundära klickmeny."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The structured child transcript has not arrived yet.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Den strukturerade barntranskriptionen har inte kommit än."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The table, outline, header, scroll, and clip boundaries are real AppKit views.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tabellen, utkastet, rubriken, scrollen och klippgränserna är verkliga AppKit-vyer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The theme file could not be found.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Temafil hittades inte."
          }
        }
