          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start Over": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Börja om"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start this chat first — watching alone never starts an agent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Starta konversationen först — att bara titta startar aldrig en agent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The above, plus every project, session, conversation and cache. Threading restarts as if newly installed.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ovanstående, plus varje projekt, session, konversation och cache. Threading startas om som om det vore nyinstallerat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Threading will restart as if newly installed: no projects, no sessions, no conversations. Everything is moved into a dated folder beside your data rather than deleted, so it can be recovered by hand.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Threading startas om som om det vore nyinstallerat: inga projekt, inga sessioner, inga konversationer. Allt flyttas till en datummärkt mapp bredvid dina data i stället för att raderas, så det kan återställas för hand."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Threading will restart with its default settings. Your projects and conversations are kept. The current settings are saved into a dated folder beside your data, so nothing is thrown away.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Threading startas om med sina standardinställningar. Dina projekt och konversationer behålls. De nuvarande inställningarna sparas i en datummärkt mapp bredvid dina data, så ingenting kastas bort."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "View only": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Endast visning"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where Threading keeps your settings and your work, and how to start over.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Var Threading sparar dina inställningar och ditt arbete, och hur du börjar om."
